   "y": 86,
   "width": 1534.5,
   "height": 18.75,
   "text": "The obvious way to build a dynamic pipeline is to pass a JObject around. This engine compiles instead, so a YAML step and a C# step are indistinguishable downstream.",
   "originalText": "The obvious way to build a dynamic pipeline is to pass a JObject around. This engine compiles instead, so a YAML step and a C# step are indistinguishable downstream.",
