   "height": 113.75,
   "text": "1  SchemaCompiler.CompileFromFolderAsync(\"schemas\")\n   runs first and on its own, one task per file\n\n   name = file name without extension; \"title\" is ignored\n   NJsonSchema generates a POCO, renamed {Name}Data\n   a wrapper {Name} : LlmStepResult<{Name}Data> is added\n   Roslyn compiles both in memory; the type is cached by name",
   "originalText": "1  SchemaCompiler.CompileFromFolderAsync(\"schemas\")\n   runs first and on its own, one task per file\n\n   name = file name without extension; \"title\" is ignored\n   NJsonSchema generates a POCO, renamed {Name}Data\n   a wrapper {Name} : LlmStepResult<{Name}Data> is added\n   Roslyn compiles both in memory; the type is cached by name",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
