   "x": 718,
   "y": 415.05,
   "width": 564,
   "height": 146.25,
   "text": "2  YamlPipelineFactory.CreateFromFolderAsync(\"pipelines\")\n\n   merge every *.yaml under the folder tree\n   discover step kinds by reflection over [YamlStepTag]:\n   !LlmStep is a tag, a new kind needs no parser change\n   deserialize with YamlDotNet and a DI object factory\n   ApplyRole: profileName (or DefaultRole) from LlmEnvironment\n   inject InputType / OutputType with GetCompiledType(name)\n   ValidateAndOrder: dependencies, schemas, cycles (below)",
   "originalText": "2  YamlPipelineFactory.CreateFromFolderAsync(\"pipelines\")\n\n   merge every *.yaml under the folder tree\n   discover step kinds by reflection over [YamlStepTag]:\n   !LlmStep is a tag, a new kind needs no parser change\n   deserialize with YamlDotNet and a DI object factory\n   ApplyRole: profileName (or DefaultRole) from LlmEnvironment\n   inject InputType / OutputType with GetCompiledType(name)\n   ValidateAndOrder: dependencies, schemas, cycles (below)",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
