   "width": 484,
   "height": 162.5,
   "text": "What Roslyn emits, per schema\n\nClassificationOutputData\n  a pure POCO, generated by NJsonSchema\n  and renamed\n\nClassificationOutput\n  : LlmStepResult<ClassificationOutputData>\n  the wrapper that flows through the\n  pipeline as an ordinary IStepResult",
   "originalText": "What Roslyn emits, per schema\n\nClassificationOutputData\n  a pure POCO, generated by NJsonSchema\n  and renamed\n\nClassificationOutput\n  : LlmStepResult<ClassificationOutputData>\n  the wrapper that flows through the\n  pipeline as an ordinary IStepResult",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
