  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "js_t",
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 900046,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 900047,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "x": 2018,
   "y": 178,
   "width": 584,
   "height": 195.0,
   "text": "Validation JSON Schema cannot express\n\nA compiled type can run a JavaScript function\nvalidate(self, context) with ClearScript V8 after\nthe model responds. It is not read from the schema\nfile: you pass it as jsValidateFunction to\nSchemaCompiler.CompileAsync(name, schema, js);\nCompileFromFolderAsync never supplies one.\n\nIt receives the whole PipelineContext, so a field\ncan be checked against an earlier step. Returning\nfalse fails structural validation and becomes a retry.",
   "originalText": "Validation JSON Schema cannot express\n\nA compiled type can run a JavaScript function\nvalidate(self, context) with ClearScript V8 after\nthe model responds. It is not read from the schema\nfile: you pass it as jsValidateFunction to\nSchemaCompiler.CompileAsync(name, schema, js);\nCompileFromFolderAsync never supplies one.\n\nIt receives the whole PipelineContext, so a field\ncan be checked against an earlier step. Returning\nfalse fails structural validation and becomes a retry.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
