   "width": 584,
   "height": 97.5,
   "text": "What compiling costs you\n\nEvery start recompiles: the types are cached in\nmemory only, with no on-disk cache by schema hash.\nEach JavaScript validation creates its own V8\nengine, with no pooling.",
