   "text": "missing schema        inputSchema and outputSchema are both required (RequireSchema, YamlPipelineFactory.cs:143)\nunknown role          profileName, or the DefaultRole, must exist in LlmEnvironment; the error lists the ones that do (:157-176)\nschema not compiled   GetCompiledType throws if the schema was never compiled (SchemaCompiler.cs:70-74)\nunknown dependency    a dependsOn naming a step that is not in the pipeline (:192)\nschema mismatch       a step's inputSchema must equal the outputSchema of every step it depends on (:200)\ncycle                 Kahn's topological sort leaves steps over (:225), so it is found before anything runs\n\nAll six fire inside CreateFromYaml. Discovering a schema mismatch three LLM calls in would cost money and time.",
   "originalText": "missing schema        inputSchema and outputSchema are both required (RequireSchema, YamlPipelineFactory.cs:143)\nunknown role          profileName, or the DefaultRole, must exist in LlmEnvironment; the error lists the ones that do (:157-176)\nschema not compiled   GetCompiledType throws if the schema was never compiled (SchemaCompiler.cs:70-74)\nunknown dependency    a dependsOn naming a step that is not in the pipeline (:192)\nschema mismatch       a step's inputSchema must equal the outputSchema of every step it depends on (:200)\ncycle                 Kahn's topological sort leaves steps over (:225), so it is found before anything runs\n\nAll six fire inside CreateFromYaml. Discovering a schema mismatch three LLM calls in would cost money and time.",
